# Cloudflare Pages redirects — https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Cloudflare Pages automatically:
#   - serves /foo.html when /foo is requested (no /foo /foo.html 200 rule needed)
#   - serves /foo/index.html when /foo/ is requested
#   - 308-redirects /foo.html → /foo (extension stripping)
# Only list rules whose destination is a *different* path from the request.
# (Adding /foo /foo.html 200 would loop with the auto-stripper.)

# ── Block dev/source folders from being publicly served ──
/scripts/*       /404                          404
/backend/*       /404                          404
/raw/*           /404                          404
/_archive_heed/* /404                          404
/.claude/*       /404                          404

# ── Folder shortcuts that point at a non-index.html file ──
